<title>PERU: Peru's money base expands 0.4 percent in June.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base expands 0.4 percent in June.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base expanded 0.4 percent during June to stand at 3.803 billion soles at the end of the month, compared with the end of May, the Central Reserve Bank said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.996 billion soles, up from 3.658 billion soles at the start of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
